  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Michael Platt is a British billionaire investor and co-founder of BlueCrest Capital Management. Born in Preston and educated at the London School of Economics, he developed his trading career at J.P. Morgan. BlueCrest became a private investment partnership, managing capital for its partners and employees after returning outside investors' money.",
